  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:182px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/OKotC.jpg\" title=\"Watcher of the Candies\"><img alt=\"Watcher of the Candies\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"179\" src=\"/images/OKotC.jpg\" width=\"180\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/OKotC.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Watcher of the Candies</div></div></div>\n<p>The <strong class=\"selflink\">Watcher of the Candies</strong> is a giant floating candy <a href=\"/wiki/Champion\" title=\"Champion\">Champion</a> who is found found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Storeroom 5A Cellar</a>. He has strong knockback powers.  When kiled he will drop lots of candy.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
